This product is a Go implementation of the Dev Container CLI,
https://github.com/devcontainers/cli, written to behave as that CLI does and
validated against it. It contains material taken from that project, which is
under the MIT License below:

  - the test fixtures under src/test/configs/;
  - internal/docker/updateUID.Dockerfile, which the binary embeds;
  - the Go code that ports that CLI's behaviour (configuration merging,
    lifecycle order, Feature and Template handling, output and errors).

